1
00:00:00,341 --> 00:00:03,131
(Raj:)You own the damn thing,
just take a freaking sweater.

2
00:00:03,303 --> 00:00:05,133
(Sheldon:)I didn't turn a profit last quarter...

3
00:00:05,305 --> 00:00:08,185
(Sheldon:)...by taking product off the shelves
willy-nilly.

4
00:00:08,850 --> 00:00:10,600
(Sheldon:)All right.

5
00:00:11,519 --> 00:00:15,019
(Raj:)You've paid for a sweater
and you're in Sheldon Square.

6
00:00:15,356 --> 00:00:17,736
Ahem. Hang on.

7
00:00:18,901 --> 00:00:21,151
(Sheldon:)It's a cardigan, I have to button it.

8
00:00:24,324 --> 00:00:26,744
(Sheldon:)-Oh, no.
-What now?

9
00:00:26,909 --> 00:00:29,749
(Sheldon:)A Godzilla-like monster
is approaching the city.

10
00:00:30,371 --> 00:00:32,161
(Sheldon:)I have to get my people to safety.

11
00:00:32,332 --> 00:00:35,712
(Sheldon:)People of Sheldonopolis,
this is your mayor.

12
00:00:35,877 --> 00:00:36,877
(Sheldon:)Follow me.

13
00:00:37,045 --> 00:00:40,885
(Sheldon:)If the children can't run,
leave them behind.

14
00:00:42,175 --> 00:00:45,845
(Sheldon:)Oh, the simulated horror.

15
00:00:46,888 --> 00:00:48,138
[DOOR CLOSES]

16
00:00:54,187 --> 00:00:56,267
(Sheldon:)Raj?

17
00:00:56,981 --> 00:00:58,021
[SIGHS]

18
00:00:58,191 --> 00:00:59,731
(Sheldon:)Just as I suspected.

19
00:00:59,901 --> 00:01:08,031
(Sheldon:)Meditation is nothing but hokum.

